  "releaseNotes": "Add the ImageComposer control for arranging images and arrows on a millimeter canvas and exporting a PNG, and rebuild the User Manager list around server-side search, filters, sorting and role badges. Fix the caller identity sent while a session is bootstrapped after simulated sign-in, and accept a standalone Android workload in Release Manager.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.19/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Ui.Wpf.Core/0.1.0-alpha.19.md",
